{"about_the_game":"<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/Local_Online.png?t=1747133330\" /></div><br>Bump your friends out of the arena in this belly-centric party game. Play with 2-8 local players on a single device! Cross-platform online multiplayer is also supported for 2-8 players.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/PickleBounce.gif?t=1747133330\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/EatBurgersText.png?t=1747133330\" /></div><br>Eat burgers to increase the size of your belly and the power of your bumpers. Be careful as you eat a variety of foods because some have horrible side effects!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/Eating.gif?t=1747133330\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/ForceFeedOpponents.png?t=1747133330\" /></div><br>Force-feed opponents until their bellies burst by slapping them in the face with food!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/Force-feed.gif?t=1747133330\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/FoodArenasText.png?t=1747133330\" /></div><br>Bump it out on over 10 food-themed stages. Each stage has unique interactive food elements such as stretchy licorice!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/WaferRing.gif?t=1747133330\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/CustomGamesText.png?t=1747133330\" /></div><br>Play with only the tastiest foods. Set your own rules, modify bump powers, choose stages, and more with in our customizable games. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/DonutSausage.gif?t=1747133330\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/TheBellyBumpersText.png?t=1747133330\" /></div><br>Meet the Belly Bumpers! Choose your favorite color Bumper to play as. Each has their own unique design and personality.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/extras/Characters.png?t=1747133330\" /></div>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2013540?t=1747133330","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2013540?t=1747133330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747133330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2013540/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747133330","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_s